{#- Quick links tile row — vertical icon-above-label cards. Composition
    kept view-local (no ship-element covers this shape today). Separated
    from index.html.j2 to stay under the 300-line file cap.

    SDK gap: this is a HARDCODED route catalog. Labels, icons, hrefs and
    color keys are duplicated here from the shell rail / router. Candidate:
    a runtime-provided `ship_quick_links()` filter (or a manifest
    declaration) that returns the same metadata the shell uses to draw its
    primary nav, so adding a first-party view adds a dashboard tile for
    free. Until that exists, both this file and the shell must be edited
    together when nav changes. -#}
